  - m_Id: 9547458479644672
    m_Localized: "\rThe Kymenlaakso Rescue Department rescues and protects people,
      property and the environment in all tasks assigned to rescue operations within
      the Kymenlaakso region. The Kymenlaakso Rescue Department coordinates preparedness
      and prevents accidents through education and creating the conditions for rescue
      operations with its skilled, motivated and dedicated personnel."
